        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_564_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_571_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You know, Master Edge, I'm kind of intrigued. What was Stitch's mentor like?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elysium"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_564_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_571_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I just knew you had an ulterior motive for coming with me, you runt.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart"
    },
    {
        "text": "You bother yourself with that Stitch boy an awful lot.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_564_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_571_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hahah, you caught me red-handed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elysium"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_564_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_571_1#10$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That's just the kind of guy I am, hoping for everyone to hit it off and make friends.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elysium"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_564_1#10$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_571_1#10$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Then you'd love his mentor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_564_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_571_1#10$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Finch Canvas was his name. Most well-loved architectural designer in all of Zeruertza.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart"
    },
    {
        "text": "His style might've been leagues apart from the Durin vogue, but when he explained things, he always our hearts doing it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart"
    },
    {
        "text": "In his words, he'd, er, what was it...? Right, 'throw off our ceaseless desires.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart"
    },
    {
        "text": "His arguments were unique, relatively, but the Zeruertzans loved him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_564_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_571_1#9$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "So why would someone like him leave?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elysium"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_564_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_571_1#9$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That's the mystery.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_564_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_571_1#7$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elysium"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_564_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_571_1#7$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "He just up and went, and never told anyone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_564_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_571_1#12$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That's... pretty weird for sure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elysium"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_564_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_571_1#12$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "As for the apprentice he left behind... we all recognize his talent, but, well, you've seen how he acts.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_564_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_571_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hahah. I bet it's to do with how his teacher suddenly left?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elysium"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_564_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_571_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "So we all reckon.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_medicalbeep",
        "channel": "a",
        "loop": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "a",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_564_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_571_1#10$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh? You got some results?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elysium"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_564_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_571_1#10$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hrmm, let's take a look...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_564_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_571_1#10$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "*sigh*...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_564_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_571_1#11$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Verdict?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elysium"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_564_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_571_1#11$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ach. More or less how you predicted.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart"
    },
    {
        "text": "We've got just under a month's time left.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "A month? Should be enough to enlarge the lifts, then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_564_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_571_1#11$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Fancy meeting you here, Gavial.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_walk_stage",
        "volume": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_572_1#7$1",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#10$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_572_1#7$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Fancy me. Looks like you don't need me to pitch in anymore?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_564_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mmm. This about does it for the survey.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0.3
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#10$1",
        "name2": "char_empty"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#10$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_564_1#1$1",
        "fadetime": 0.5
    },
    {
