    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#10$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_564_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you win over Avdotya?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#10$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_564_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Sure did. She said she'll help talk the Zeruertzans into it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#10$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_564_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Good. All that's left should be putting out the official city-wide notice of the situation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's not just deciding how to head to the surface. We've got to settle the matter of the dome too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_564_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? What's up with the dome?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_564_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, silly me. Nearly forgot you aren't Durins.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_564_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Right. Calamity doesn't come for Durin cities so often, but it's a decent bet a Durin has his city wrecked at least once in his life.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart"
    },
    {
        "text": "It doesn't haunt us to leave the homes we grew up in.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart"
    },
    {
        "text": "Contrarily, you see, we always make sure our cities are in the best condition before we leave them, so they greet destruction the finest they can be.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_564_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Wow, that kicks ass!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_564_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "So you think? It's only natural for us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart"
    },
    {
        "text": "And no matter why that hole's been sitting in the dome all this time, we've got to do something about it now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#10$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_564_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, speaking of the dome, where's Stitch?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#10$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_564_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Eh? Wasn't he with you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_564_1#5$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What? He said he was gonna find you guys.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_572_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gavial, do you need Stitch?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You know where he went?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_572_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mm-hm. I met him when we came in. He didn't say anything to me, he just went outside the cave.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
