    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "30_g5_library_indoor",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_075"
    },
    {
        "text": "You solemnly swear to us you have a map, and now you tell us that map's likely in some book on a shelf somewhere?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Clears throat) I can hardly do anything about that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've had no interest in returning to the surface, after all. You should be content with the fact I could remember once seeing a forebear's map recorded in a book.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "If that cave network turns out to be as complex as you say, then I don't mind spending a little more of the time we do have.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "So, do you still remember what exactly that book was called?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've forgotten. I vaguely recall it should be a travel log, detailing the Durin author's variegated experiences on the surface.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_075"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's the point of asking, anyway? It's not as if we can read Durish.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't, but don't forget. I've got my friends here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_robotwalk"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_576_1#1$1",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Zumama. Zumama. Do you require help?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Strange Machine #0429"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "I want to find this travel log Avdotya's talking about, with a map recording the route through the cave network to the surface.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_576_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_576_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Library books: infrequently sorted. Difficulty of search: relatively high.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Strange Machine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you find it, I'll give you all an intense round of maintenance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_576_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Zumama: friend. Assist Zumama.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Strange Machine #0429"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_576_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_576_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Assist Zumama. Assist Zumama.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Strange Machine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_075"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fantastic. Take it away, then. I'll be waiting outside. Remember to shout for me if something gives you trouble.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yep.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_075"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
