        "fadetime": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, I'm here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Priest"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Pitch in.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What in the...?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "A friend of mine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_074"
    },
    {
        "text": "Shouldn't you have asked me first if I knew any Durish, Zumama?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Priest"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is there any way you wouldn't?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_074"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh. Are you still miffed I never told you about all this business underground?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Priest"
    },
    {
        "text": "You see, Zumama, if I regaled you about every last thing I knew, you could figure out how to construct an entire nomadic city and build it too before I finished.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Priest"
    },
    {
        "text": "I personally believe the pursuit of knowledge has to rest at some point, though I'm not a person per se.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Priest"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Will you help or not?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_074"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you'll pardon me once I find it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Priest"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Deal.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
