    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_075",
        "name2": "avg_npc_566_1#1$1",
        "fadetime": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_075",
        "name2": "avg_npc_566_1#4$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Er, Inam, what are you standing at the library doors for?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croque Diamondface"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_075",
        "name2": "avg_npc_566_1#4$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm waiting for someone. And you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_075",
        "name2": "avg_npc_566_1#8$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Library caretaker called me over to discuss something about refurbishing the place.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croque Diamondface"
    },
    {
        "text": "He's been wanting to, but never got around to it. Now's a good chance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croque Diamondface"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_075",
        "name2": "avg_npc_566_1#8$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I've been a little curious about that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "text": "Plenty of time's passed since the broadcast, and, okay, none of the city's Durins are panicking, but...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why are some even planning to refurbish their buildings?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_075",
        "name2": "avg_npc_566_1#4$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm? Oh, right, you're a surface-dweller. I see, it would be lost on you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croque Diamondface"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_075",
        "name2": "avg_npc_566_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You have built those roving cities to avoid disasters, haven't you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croque Diamondface"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_075",
        "name2": "avg_npc_566_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_075",
        "name2": "avg_npc_566_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "But we're different, see. Our cities can't move about.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croque Diamondface"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_075",
        "name2": "avg_npc_566_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Nomadicizing cities built underground would be much more of a challenge, yes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_075",
        "name2": "avg_npc_566_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Between you and me, I've heard of masters who've had thoughts of building cities just like that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croque Diamondface"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_075",
        "name2": "avg_npc_566_1#9$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You see, if we fit rock-crushers and borer planes and the like onto the dome, and slipped a base plate under the whole city, it might just be within reach.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croque Diamondface"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_075",
        "name2": "avg_npc_566_1#9$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Er... I'm not great with construction, but that sounds even crazier than our nomadic cities are.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_075",
        "name2": "avg_npc_566_1#8$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "And I've never heard of anyone looking to actually pull it off, truth be told.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croque Diamondface"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_075",
        "name2": "avg_npc_566_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Anywho, our cities don't move. Unnomadic, if you will.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croque Diamondface"
    },
    {
        "text": "But. Every one of our cities does have Originium vein detector facilities, which send off an alert when one of them encroaches.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croque Diamondface"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_075",
        "name2": "avg_npc_566_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I wonder if those sensors could replace the jobs of Catastrophe Messengers...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_075",
        "name2": "avg_npc_566_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I've heard of them. It's not quite apples to apples, see, because the spread of Originium veins is the only thing our sensors can pick up on.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croque Diamondface"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_075",
        "name2": "avg_npc_566_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "True. Judging from what I've heard, there's also a stretch of time from vein discovery to vein activation, and outside of special circumstances like now, you'd plenty of time to evacuate.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "text": "But if hints of a Catastrophe were detected, getting so much time to react would be a miracle.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "text": "Circling back\u2014you're used to abandoning your own cities, then?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_075",
        "name2": "avg_npc_566_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Exactly the opposite, if I had to say.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croque Diamondface"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_566_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Durins adore everything that ties to this land. We adore machinery, buildings, every city we build.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croque Diamondface"
    },
    {
        "text": "But should disaster insist on its way, then our cities are bound to be destroyed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croque Diamondface"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_566_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And if we're going to face up to that reality, then there's something we have to consider.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croque Diamondface"
    },
    {
        "text": "A city's inhabitants leave it because of calamity, but calamity doesn't last forever. There'll be other Durins, maybe even our own offspring and theirs, who'll come upon that same land once again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croque Diamondface"
    },
    {
        "text": "They'll see the city's remains, they'll lament the disaster that befell it, but as the people who once lived and breathed in it, is that really all we want them to come and learn?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croque Diamondface"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is surrender our only choice, in the face of our inescapable fate?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croque Diamondface"
    },
    {
        "text": "We don't accept that. We choose\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croque Diamondface"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_566_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We decide, before calamity strikes, what shape our city is going to greet its ruin in.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croque Diamondface"
    },
    {
        "text": "We set out to make our progeny marvel at the fruits of our technology, to make them gasp at the traces we've left behind, to make them toast with their finest tipple to all our achievements.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croque Diamondface"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just as we find other fallen cities, and do the very same.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croque Diamondface"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course we're sad to have to leave where we grew, but it's a sadness we're accustomed to.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croque Diamondface"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_566_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And in said times for us, upkeeping our city such that it's in best condition becomes more meaningful than ever, doesn't it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croque Diamondface"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's the body. It's what we call dressing our doomed city.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croque Diamondface"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_075"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's such a... romantic notion.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_566_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course it is. The more straightforward reason is, we can build a brand new city in as quickly a few months, provided we bring the key industrial equipment and have our robots assisting.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croque Diamondface"
    },
    {
        "text": "We'd never have the resources to spare for this otherwise.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croque Diamondface"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_075"
    },
    {
        "text": "Haha. Yes, good point.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
