    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "This one? Also no.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "Sound_Beta_2/Player/p_atk/p_atk_book_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "This one\u2014er, what's this doing here? I'll take it with me later.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#1$1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1#1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "right",
        "type": "move",
        "xpos": 50,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "right",
        "type": "move",
        "xpos": -50,
        "fadetime": 0.3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_paper1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#1$1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "This book? It's a Kazimierzian knight novel... Is it yours?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#9$1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, right, you can at least tell what that one is. It slipped my mind...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I suppose it is. I brought it from the surface.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#9$1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "About that...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "text": "How exactly did a lone Ursus like you wander all the way from Ursus to a Durin city?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#7$1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "text": "My family all died in a noble conflict that had absolutely no honor to speak of, and I was forced to flee from my home.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Assassins trailed me throughout my escape, until I eventually fled into a cavern.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Its structure was as complex as the one above the lift here, and I happened to find such a lift that led underground.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "text": "And that's how I had the fortune to survive. It was that simple.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#7$1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, that sure was pretty lucky.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#4$1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you have no other thoughts?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#4$1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Were you hoping for any?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#7$1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...*sigh* No wonder you're a friend of Gavial's.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#7$1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I've heard a lot of stories similar to yours aboard Rhodes Island.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're already lucky enough just to have survived.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#7$1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Zeruertza's a good place. It'd be pretty nice, living somewhere like this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#9$1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It is.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I thought, originally, I'd be a lot angrier about the circumstances I'd landed in.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "text": "But had my family really been so guiltless, my parents so benevolent in their day-to-day, simply befallen by wicked men's hate?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course not.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "text": "My father still cursed his antagonists more than he cared for his own family, right until his final moments.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "text": "As I fled out from the back of our home, I knew nothing of even the whereabouts of my mother.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "text": "And I\u2014I was no more than an insignificant sacrifice in a sea of Ursus noble conspiracy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#1$1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You're right, I'm very lucky. That's why I have to cherish this hard-won luck as well as I can.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#1$1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "For sure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#1$1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#1$1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You're cruising to pick a huge argument with Gavial, am I right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#4$1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What gives you that idea?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#4$1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Because she might've talked you over, but thinking about it carefully, you never actually said what you really wanted to say.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "text": "And you tried to argue with her again, but then you lost the opportunity, so your only choice was to bite your tongue.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've seen a lot of people pissed off by Gavial's whole personality\u2014she gets me too, sometimes\u2014and you're the most obvious kind about it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#9$1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, I admit it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#6$1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I've never met anyone like Gavial. Whether I'm Ursus or Durin, getting a handle on her is... elusive.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#6$1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "If there's something you need to get off your mind, you can tell me. You've helped me out. I'll think about passing it onto her for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#9$1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll refrain. I'm not in straits that desperate yet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#1$1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "However, I do have a proposal.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have no plans to formally make a return to surface life.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Once the danger is past, I'll be proposing the Durins return underground.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course, contact can never be easily severed once made, and so breaking off dealings will be nigh-impossible. I recognize that much.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "text": "And I admit that you, the Tiacauh of Acahualla, may be possible relational targets.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#10$1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Thus, once the Durins rebuild their city underground, I'll invite you all to relocate from a rainforest void of anything, to the land beneath the surface.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "text": "At that point, I'm sure even one of Gavial's nature will understand just how wonderful Durin society is.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#10$1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm... yeah, we'll pass.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#6$1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Why?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#6$1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's get back to that once we find the map.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
